# {{name}}

An idle game on the watchpot engine ({{engine}}): one button, one number, a saved setting. Nothing else yet.

Needs Bun 1.4.3 or later (`bun check` typechecks).

## Commands

```sh
bun install
bun run dev        # http://localhost:3000 (PORT=<n> for another)
bun run verify     # typecheck and lint
bun run gates      # typecheck, lint, the build
bun run lint:fix   # format
```

## Where things are

- `src/game/` the game: `words.ts` (its name and currency), `game.ts` (the wallet, the settings and `defineGame`: the
  feature list and the save), `store.ts` (the store, saved to localStorage).
- `src/App.tsx` the page, `src/hooks.ts` the typed store hooks, `src/main.tsx` the mount.
{{componentsLine}}
The engine's guide is its `README.md` and `docs/` (`node_modules/watchpot/`). To move to a newer engine, change the
version on `watchpot` in `package.json` and install again.
